silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_05_tree_evaluation_duality_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'TreeEvaluationDualityConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, CataMorphism_VetRecord_Colimit: the catamorphism that folds VetRecord_77_tree (the publish tree in mu Sigma) to MittensColimitApex (via the colimit structure map); tree evaluation: consuming the tree to produce a colimit value." .
